   "text": "CI/CD\nGitHub Actions: lint \u00b7 typecheck \u00b7 unit + Playwright\nvisual tests \u2192 Docker \u2192 registry \u2192 Argo CD (GitOps)\ncanary / blue-green with instant rollback\nfrontend preview deploy per PR",
